  "concept_summary": "Supported cross-bolt: a receiver bridge supports the keeper on both sides of the adapter while retained.",
  "description": "Compact printed supported cross-bolt hardpoint with a mini solenoid and a removable payload lug.",
  "why_consider": "Four printed parts and one purchased mini solenoid. An integral receiver bridge supports the keeper on both sides of the retained payload lug.",
  "main_risk": "Only 0.6 mm nominal distal engagement. Distal support is lost before the lug clears during withdrawal. The 1.4 mm lug and supported-to-overhung transition need physical verification.",
